<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Washington Fed upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Washington Fed upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said analyst Bruce Harting upgraded Washington Federal Savings &amp; Loan Association to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- expects earnings to grow up to 18 percent in 1997, ending next September, and 14 percent in 1998.</p>
<p>-- said thrift &quot;runs one of the tightest ships in either the bank or thrift industry.&quot;</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1/4 to 24-3/8.</p>
</text>
